      "label": "Section 1 .",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13633#sec1",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "77 FR 76339, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "283471047a4a12976246a1eaafef30ad459e6f44d7641833d6c7267ab0c7aa72",
        "signing_date": "2012-12-21",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13633.txt",
        "text_sha256": "f4d79654f2e66bb34380a1b7c19973ad67366c67ded7dec9b19bdf28ea81db1c",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2012-12-28/pdf/2012-31225.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Section 1 . All executive branch departments and agencies of the Federal \nGovernment shall be closed and their employees excused from duty on \nMonday, December 24, 2012, the day before Christmas Day, except as pro-\nvided in section 2 of this order."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 1468,
      "char_start": 1154,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13633#sec2",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 2.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13633#sec2",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "77 FR 76339, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "283471047a4a12976246a1eaafef30ad459e6f44d7641833d6c7267ab0c7aa72",
        "signing_date": "2012-12-21",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13633.txt",
        "text_sha256": "f4d79654f2e66bb34380a1b7c19973ad67366c67ded7dec9b19bdf28ea81db1c",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2012-12-28/pdf/2012-31225.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 2. The heads of executive branch departments and agencies may deter-\nmine that certain offices and installations of their organizations, or parts \nthereof, must remain open and that certain employees must report for duty \non December 24, 2012, for reasons of national security, defense, or other \npublic need."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 1742,
      "char_start": 1470,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13633#sec3",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 3 .",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13633#sec3",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "77 FR 76339, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "283471047a4a12976246a1eaafef30ad459e6f44d7641833d6c7267ab0c7aa72",
        "signing_date": "2012-12-21",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13633.txt",
        "text_sha256": "f4d79654f2e66bb34380a1b7c19973ad67366c67ded7dec9b19bdf28ea81db1c",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2012-12-28/pdf/2012-31225.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 3 . Monday, December 24, 2012, shall be considered as falling within \nthe scope of Executive Order 11582 of February 11, 1971, and of 5 U.S.C. \n5546 and 6103(b) and other similar statutes insofar as they relate to the \npay and leave of employees of the United States."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 1873,
      "char_start": 1744,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13633#sec4",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 4 .",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13633#sec4",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "77 FR 76339, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "283471047a4a12976246a1eaafef30ad459e6f44d7641833d6c7267ab0c7aa72",
        "signing_date": "2012-12-21",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13633.txt",
        "text_sha256": "f4d79654f2e66bb34380a1b7c19973ad67366c67ded7dec9b19bdf28ea81db1c",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2012-12-28/pdf/2012-31225.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 4 . The Director of the Office of Personnel Management shall take \nsuch actions as may be necessary to implement this order."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2022,
      "char_start": 1875,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13633#sec5",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 5 .",
