      "text": "(ii) the functions of the Director of the Office of Management and \nBudget relating to budgetary, administrative, or legislative proposals. \nVerDate Mar<15>2010 19:30 Dec 27, 2012 Jkt 229001 PO 00000 Frm 00001 Fmt 4705 Sfmt 4790 E:\\FR\\FM\\28DEE0.SGM 28DEE0srobinson on DSK4SPTVN1PROD with \n=== PDF page 2 of 2 ===\n76340 Federal Register / Vol. 77, No. 249 / Friday, December 28, 2012 / Presidential Documents"
